From 819016b83b6fcdd9ec4887219ade8871235591d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: crossainthero <billymillena@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:52:57 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] sarness: own storage directories, executable identity and
 installer behaviour

- data/config/state/cache under sarness-code, so a separate opencode install is never read or modified
- executable name sarness-tui; user-facing CLI strings say Sarness
- upgrade/uninstall refuse: Sarness installs and upgrades its terminal itself
